  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El barrio del Arrabal del Castillo, en Onda, inicia la noche de este viernes con la presentaci&oacute;n de la reina, Ana Gargallo Porcar, tambi&eacute;n reina de la Fira 2014, sus fiestas, que se extender&aacute;n hasta el domingo 20 de julio, y que tuvieron su pr&oacute;logo en junio con los D&iacute;as Vecinales (en la foto principal y la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes de m&aacute;s abajo, la cena del s&aacute;bado 21 de junio).</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6961.jpg\" alt=\"img_6961\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6963.jpg\" alt=\"img_6963\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6967.jpg\" alt=\"img_6967\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6968.jpg\" alt=\"img_6968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6970.jpg\" alt=\"img_6970\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6973.jpg\" alt=\"img_6973\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6974.jpg\" alt=\"img_6974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sopardiaveinatravalcastell/img_6975.jpg\" alt=\"img_6975\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/so